      "files": [
        "Cargo.toml",
        "Cargo.lock"
      ],
      "kind": "packaging",
      "origin": "treebank; upstream owns the tree-sitter-rust name on crates.io, so a redistribution has to publish under its own: package name, repository, homepage and description. [lib] name stays upstream's so the crate is a drop-in. include gains LICENSE, ledger.json, LOCAL-PATCHES.md and patches/* so provenance travels inside the published tarball. Cargo.lock's stale 0.24.1 self-version is corrected to match the manifest. The published version string is deliberately NOT here: publish.sh derives it from crates.io at publish time. See PUBLISHING.md."
    },
